    historyContent: {
      origins: 'The first known description of Bismarck appeared in 1944 in Sweden. According to Sten Helmfrid (Kartofilen, July 2024), the game was likely named after the famous German battleship Bismarck, which was sunk in 1941 â€” making this a WW2-era card game.',
      originCountries: [
        'Sweden',
