        medium: 'Evaluates hand strength before choosing contract. Basic discard strategy (void suits for trump, shed high cards for Pass). Standard trick-play heuristics.',
        hard: 'Optimal contract selection based on full hand evaluation plus face-up cards. Perfect discard strategy. Card counting for all 52 cards. Plans contract sequencing across 12-deal game for maximum cumulative score.',
