          ai: 'Game: Bismarck. 3 players. 52 cards. 16 tricks per deal. 12 deals total. 4 contracts (Sang, Pass, Spader, Valfri) â€” each used once per player. Forehand picks up 4 face-up cards, discards 4, chooses contract. Quotas: forehand 8 (or 4 in Pass), others 4 (or 6 in Pass). Score: +1/-1 per trick over/under quota. Zero-sum.',
